const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文检验以市场、规模、投资和盈利因子构成的q因子模型，能否概括大量已报告收益异象的横截面表现。 阅读时应将其放回原始样本、时点和制度环境中理解，不能把问题本身当作跨市场结论。",en:"The article examines whether a q-factor model built around market, size, investment, and profitability factors summarizes a broad cross-section of reported return anomalies. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhu068",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它在一组异象上比较多个因子模型，因子定义、组合构造、检验样本和基准模型均属于研究设计。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中任一选择，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It compares factor-model performance across a large anomaly inventory, so factor definitions, portfolio construction, test sample, and benchmark models are part of the experiment. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhu068",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要时点一致的证券收益、市值、投资与盈利变量、退市处理、因子构造、断点规则、组合定义和样本资格日期。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选必须与原研究分开记录，不能因变量同名或使用最新修订值便视为可比。",en:"A comparable exercise needs point-in-time security returns, market equity, investment and profitability measures, delisting treatment, factor construction rules, portfolio breakpoints, and dated sample eligibility. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhu068",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"公开摘要报告q因子模型可解释所考察集合中的许多但非全部异象；这不是所有异象消失或扣成本后可交易的证明。 它只支持来源描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"Its public abstract reports that the q-factor model accounts for many, but not all, anomalies in its examined set; it is not proof that every named anomaly disappears or is investable after costs. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhu068",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"冻结异象定义和文献集合；保留会计可得日期与退出证券；复现因子和断点规则；将基准、成本和多重检验选择分开报告。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Freeze the anomaly definitions and publication set; retain accounting availability dates and exits; reproduce factor and breakpoint rules; and report benchmarks, costs, and multiple-testing choices separately. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhu068",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Review of Financial Studies · DOI record。历史模型比较不是实时因子建议、预期收益保证，也不能用之后的会计重述值回填当时信息集。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Review of Financial Studies · DOI record. A historical model comparison is not a live factor recommendation, a guarantee of expected returns, or permission to use later accounting revisions in an earlier information set. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhu068",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies · DOI record · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Digesting Anomalies: An Investment Approach”公开说明的研究对象、设计与适用边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。历史模型比较不是实时因子建议、预期收益保证，也不能用之后的会计重述值回填当时信息集。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Digesting Anomalies: An Investment Approach”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
